  "notes": "Drawn from left-side photos (2023-05-16, 2024-02-25); a 2021 left-side shot agrees. The flag round the tail cone is partly hidden by the tailplane in every photo, so its stripes are low confidence. Small markings not drawn: an FDNY patch and a US flag by the forward door, 'Honored to support New York's Bravest' near the aft door. Re-checked 2026-11-15: 'jetBlue' placed as on the standard (measured in metres on the A321neo N2017J and checked on A320s: x 0.174-0.356 of an A320, cap 1.57 m, lowercase 0.76 of the capitals); 'jetblue.com' on the A320's nacelle x 0.43-0.79 (read off N615JB and N627JB); the name under the cockpit given its length."
